{"id":"n16556-4-6","stage":2,"title":"날카롭다 · 刺耳","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16556-4-6-1","ko":"무슨 냄새지?","zh":"是什么味道啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄새지?","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]}],"audio":"/audio/5989ecb0d50df97396cd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16556-4-6-2","ko":"날카로운 냄새가 코를 찌르는데요?","zh":"有股刺鼻的味道直往鼻子里钻呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날카로운","meaning":"刺耳，刺鼻，尖利","explanation":"날카롭다：刺耳，刺鼻，尖利；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"날카롭다","audio":"/audio/11cf5a27ff6914ba176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16556","senseId":"4","lemma":"날카롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코를","meaning":"鼻，鼻子","explanation":"코：鼻，鼻子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"코","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46814","senseId":"1","lemma":"코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찌르는데요?","meaning":"刺鼻，扑鼻","explanation":"찌르다：刺鼻，扑鼻；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"찌르다","audio":"/audio/0fb4e786abddd81c7cf7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71364","senseId":"6","lemma":"찌르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11cf5a27ff6914ba","term":"날카롭다","zh":"刺耳，刺鼻，尖利","audio":"/audio/11cf5a27ff6914ba176c.mp3","entryId":"16556","definition":"强度很强，给人一种不愉快的感觉。","pronunciation":["날카롭따"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"f4f759edb468db53","term":"코","zh":"鼻，鼻子","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3","entryId":"46814","definition":"用于呼吸、闻味儿的身体的一个部位。","pronunciation":["코"]},{"id":"0fb4e786abddd81c","term":"찌르다","zh":"刺鼻，扑鼻","audio":"/audio/0fb4e786abddd81c7cf7.mp3","entryId":"71364","definition":"气味太强而刺激嗅觉。","pronunciation":["찌르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6213c4b0e211c047cec3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.2,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16556","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"중급","day":73,"sequenceScore":2.0267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是什么味道啊？","有股刺鼻的味道直往鼻子里钻呢。","啊，今天上班的路也堵得要命啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是什么味道啊？","有股刺鼻的味道直往鼻子里钻呢。","啊，今天上班的路也堵得要命啊。"],"answer":1}]}
